// src/lib/bearCallSpreadTable.ts
// AUTO-GENERATED, bilingual, from the reviewed 540-row bear-call-spread advisory
// document (bearcallspread_audit_fixed_v2.md, corrected 2026-09-18). The `zh` table
// is xue's reviewed content verbatim. The `en` table (added 2026-09-18) is a careful
// translation done from a much smaller set of underlying pieces, not 540 independent
// translations: the 540 cells reduce to 5 zone-level desc templates + 14 distinct
// advice strings (verified by exact-match grouping over the zh content), each
// translated once and then recombined per-cell with the zone/period/bracket labels'
// English forms — so the en table's action grid and cell-by-cell structure are
// mechanically identical to zh (same script, checked 0 diffs), only the wording is
// new. Do not hand-edit — regenerate from the source markdown/translation script if
// the content changes.
//
// Table indexed [zoneIndex][periodIndex][bracketIndex] -> [action, desc, advice].
// zoneIndex/periodIndex/bracketIndex meanings are given by the exported label arrays
// below (zoneLabels/periodLabels/bracketLabels), used only for reference/debugging —
// classification into these indices from real numbers happens in situationExplainer.ts.
//
// KNOWN CAVEAT (xue + Claude, 2026-09-18): the loss-side cells for zone 0 (深盈区/
// Deep-profit) and zone 1 (近盈利区/Near-the-money) in this table default to CLOSE for
// every period except the first, regardless of how small the loss is — this ignores
// actual loss magnitude and contradicts those zones' own "structurally safe" framing.
// situationExplainer.ts does NOT use this table's loss-side cells for zones 0/1 — it
// instead applies the same 70%-of-max-loss danger threshold already used for bull put
// spreads (VERTICAL_DANGER_LOSS_PCT) directly against the live P&L. This table is kept
// as the verbatim source-of-truth for everything else (profit-side cells all zones,
// and all cells in zones 2/3/4 where the short leg is already tested/ITM).

